Z||000000||ernst||09-06-99||09:30 AM||||The car I plan on buying is a five cylinder engine 1987 pontiac fiero.  It'll be my first car.  It's suntan, great condition (56,000 miles on it).  Is insurance high on these cars or medium or what?  I figured it would be medium because it's a sporty car, but only has a 5 cylinder engine.  what do you guys think?
